     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>The ideas page mentions Micheal Lawrence as the mentor.</div><div>The test task for the Interactive plots for scientific reports is to u<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\">se ggbio::autoplot to plot one of the GRanges objects created by </span><a href=\"http://rwiki.sciviews.org/rhelp.php?id=example\" title=\"example(topic, package = NULL, lib.loc = NULL, local = FALSE, echo = TRUE, verbose = getOption(&quot;verbose&quot;), setRNG = FALSE, prompt.echo = paste(abbreviate(topic, 6), &quot;&gt; &quot;, sep = &quot;&quot;))\" style=\"color:rgb(67,105,118);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rwiki.sciviews.org/rhelp.php?id%3Dexample&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792351702599000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZTkIUwhFnC43rGhBeK629\">example</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\">(GRanges) and create an equivalent D3-based plot that displays the some aspect of the ranges (like the score) as a tooltip on mouse over.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\">I have created a quite similar project. Please let me know if this is acceptable as an entrance task. I am familiar with frameworks like D3 but I am not sure if I&#39;ll be able to complete the second part of the task due to lack of time (only a day remaining to submit proposal).</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\">PFA the file.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\">Thanks,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Grande&#39;,Verdana,Lucida,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:justify\">Shubham</span></div></div>"
